            set the \texttt{siintegrate} option to override \texttt{{\textbackslash}PTquantity} and \texttt{{\textbackslash}PTqty} with \texttt{{\textbackslash}ITqty} (not 
            recommended).

            If two opposite options — one of them with the name of the other prefixed with a  \texttt{no} — 
            are loaded at the same time, the one without the \texttt{no} in the name will be used. If 
            two opposite options which have the same suffix and different prefixes are loaded at the same time, the 
