            Documentation (no language specified): xdoc2 documentation: https://ctan.org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/xdoc/xdoc2.pdf;
            Documentation (no language specified): Demonstration of usage: https://ctan.org/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/xdoc/xdocdemo.pdf;
